      "real": "Hamilton leads from pole. R\u00e4ikk\u00f6nen and then Hamilton stop early for softs while Vettel stays out. Both Haas cars retire after their stops with loosely fitted wheels, and under the virtual safety car for Grosjean's car Vettel makes his only stop and comes out ahead of Hamilton. Hamilton stays second to the flag, and Vettel wins by 5.036 s."
