    "briefing": "Melbourne, 2018. Hamilton leads from pole with R\u00e4ikk\u00f6nen second, and you run Vettel in third, sixteen laps in. R\u00e4ikk\u00f6nen and Hamilton will stop before you. Cover them or stay out longer, and find a way to come out ahead of Hamilton without having to pass him on the track."
